==Russian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|запо́й}}

===Etymology 1===
{{inh+|ru|sla-pro|*zapojь}}. Compare {{m|ru|запи́ть}}. See {{m|sla-pro|*piti}} for more information.

====Noun====
{{ru-noun+|запо́й}}

# [[binge]], [[bout]], [[drinking bout]] (recurring drunkenness due to a pathological craving for alcoholic drink; a period of continuous drunkenness)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[неде́льный]] '''запо́й'''|week-long binge}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[частый|ча́стые]] '''запо́и'''|frequent binges}}
# [[booze]]
# {{lb|ru|by extension}} [[binge]] (without stopping, in immoderate quantities; with unbridled enthusiasm)
#: {{uxi|ru|[[кури́ть]] '''запо́ем'''|have a smoking binge}}
#: {{uxi|ru|[[чита́ть]] '''запо́ем'''|have a reading binge}}

